      "evidenceText": "Consulting & Coaching - Poynter Consulting & Coaching - Poynter DONATE What do you want to search? Submit Sign In | Membership News Training Ethics Fact-Checking Media Literacy AI Events Future of Public Media Newmark Ethics Center IFCN MediaWise PolitiFact Donate About Us Press Freedom Watch The Poynter 50 Podcasts Artificial Intelligence Business & Work Reporting & Editing Fact-Checking Ethics & Trust Local News Journalism, Media & Communication Training Poynter Membership Categories Consulting & Coaching For ACES Members For Local News Funders All Categories Broadcast & Visual Journalism Business & Work Ethics Fact-Checking & Media Literacy Leadership Reporting & Editing Writing Poynter ACES Introductory Certificate in Editing Poynter ACES Intermediate Certificate in Editing Poynter ACES Advanced Certificate in Editing Workshops and Coaching Tools for Funders Ethics Ethics Training Ethics Articles AI Ethics Public Editor Project Get Ethics Advice Fact-Checking Articles IFCN IFCN Grants International Fact-Checking Day Teen Creator Network PolitiFact MediaWise Media Literacy Resources AI Literacy Ambassadors Teen Creator Network Research & News International en Español MediaWise Training All Events The 2026 Poynter Journalism Prizes Poynter’s experts help you solve the problems that keep you up at night through consulting, coaching, custom training and facilitation.   At Poynter, we understand the pressures you’re navigating – from financial constraints to audience shifts, management challenges to ethical dilemmas. Our trainers and coaches provide practical, customized solutions built on decades of industry expertise. We don’t offer generic approaches. Poynter delivers actionable strategies tailored to your specific needs, including training managers to lead high-performing teams, facilitating strategic planning retreats, and offering personalized consulting to help move change forward, develop your ethics and standards, or navigate a crisis.