      "pageDescription": "Find a face from one photo. FaceSeek is an AI reverse image search that scans millions of sources — social media, news, mugshots, and more — in seconds.",
      "evidenceText": "FaceSeek - AI Reverse Image Search 01 [ face search ] Find a face from one photo Upload a clear photo and we'll search across millions of sources. Social Media Sex Offenders Mugshots Scammers Videos News & Blogs Drop a face image here PNG or JPG up to 50MB. We host it on a fast CDN and run the same pipeline the app uses. Upload file Normal Credits 0 left Deep search Credits 0 left Top-up 02 pricing Pay for what you search Start free, then pick a credit pack that fits. No hidden fees, cancel anytime. Free Trial the core search flow before choosing a paid tier. $0 / forever normal 2 credits deep search No deep search 2 total credits No card required Top 2 results only No auto-refresh Start free Starter weekly access A sharper entry plan for occasional investigations. $5 / per week normal 5 Normal Credits / Week deep search 3 Deep Search Credits 5 Normal Credits / Week 3 Deep Search Credits All Source Link Unlocked Choose Starter Daily Pro most chosen Daily search capacity with priority help when it matters. $20 / per month normal 25 Normal Credits / Day deep search 15 Deep Search Credits 25 Normal Credits / Day 15 Deep Search Credits Premium Support All Source Link Unlocked Choose Daily Pro Business high volume Built for teams that need scale, support, and removal workflows. $50 / per month normal Unlimited Normal Searches deep search 50 Deep Search Credits Unlimited Normal Searches 50 Deep Search Credits Take Down Request 24/7 Premium Support All Source Link Unlocked Choose Business 03 faq Questions, answered 0 1 Do I need a credit card to start? No. Every new account gets 2 free credits on signup with no card required, so you can try a real face search before paying anything. 0 2 How do credits work? Most plans use one normal credit per face search. Business includes unlimited normal searches, while Deep Search always uses its separate credit pool. 0 3 What is Deep Search? Deep Search is a more thorough search that descends past the indexed web — crawling forums, archives and unindexed sources to surface matches a normal scan misses. It draws from a separate Deep Search credit pool, included in paid plans and toppable with packs that never expire. 0 4 What is the 20% referral reward? Every account gets a unique referral code. When someone you refer subscribes to a paid plan, you earn 20% of the price — on their first payment and every renewal after. 0 5 Can I cancel anytime? Yes. Cancelling moves you back to the Free plan immediately and keeps your account intact. You can resubscribe whenever you like. 0 6 Can I delete my data? Absolutely. A single action removes your account along with all subscriptions, credit history, uploads and referral data.",
